Col. Witney is a grizzled, battle-scarred [[Bestiary/Spark of Humanity#Dwarf|Dwarf]] from the [[Geography/Althane/Lunae Badlands/Hidden Gulch/index|Hidden Gulch]]. He keeps his uniform in pristine condition, with nary a speck of dust despite working in a desert canyon.

Witney is the second-highest ranking soldier in Fort Sera and was their representative for negotiations with [[Org/Althane/Red Dragon Rail Company|RDRco]] in the northern part of the Gulch.
